+   Not taken: the palette, the typeface, the logo lockup, the illustration
+   language, the blue-violet gradients. Copying those would put a Toronto
+   hardwood company in a cloud provider's clothes — legally other people's trade
+   dress, and strategically an own goal. Cream, walnut and copper say wood. That
